(Problem Context: Implement modern fluid typography that smoothly scales between minimum) Tj
T*
(18px and maximum 36px based on viewport width without rigid media queries.) Tj
T*
(CSS Source Code:) Tj
T*
(/* Fluid Responsive Typography using clamp\(min, preferred, max\) */) Tj
T*
(h1.fluid-title {) Tj
T*
(font-size: clamp\(1.5rem, 1rem + 2.5vw, 3rem\);) Tj
T*
(/* At 320px viewport: clamp resolves to minimum 1.5rem \(24px\) */) Tj
T*
(/* At 1600px viewport: clamp resolves to maximum 3.0rem \(48px\) */) Tj
T*
(/* Smooth mathematical linear scaling in between! */) Tj
T*
(}) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(.fluid-container {) Tj
T*
(width: clamp\(300px, 90vw, 1200px\); /* Responsive container with min/max caps */) Tj
T*
(margin-inline: auto;) Tj
T*
(}) Tj
T*
(Key Benefit: Completely eliminates choppy font jumps at arbitrary media query) Tj
T*
(breakpoints.) Tj
