(>> 3.5 University Review & Examination Questions) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(* Q1: Explain the Mobile-First design philosophy and contrast its CSS architecture) Tj
T*
(against the Desktop-First approach.) Tj
T*
(Answer: Mobile-First design begins by designing and coding the web application for the) Tj
T*
(smallest display viewports \(smartphones\) first, considering core content, minimal) Tj
T*
(bandwidth, and touch ergonomics. In CSS, base rules contain no media queries and apply) Tj
T*
(to mobile devices by default. Progressive enhancements for larger screens are layered on) Tj
T*
(using 'min-width' media queries \(@media \(min-width: 768px\)\). Desktop-First designs for) Tj
T*
